COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.mint_club_chips(p_club_id uuid, p_amount numeric, p_minted_by uuid, p_diamonds_cost numeric, p_notes text) IS 'BUG 025: real implementation replacing silent-success stub. Unified signature (p_club_id, p_amount, p_minted_by?, p_diamonds_cost?, p_notes?) accepts both admin-mint and union-mint call patterns. Atomically credits clubs.chip_pool and writes chip_transactions mint row.';


