-- Name: FUNCTION sum_agent_volume(p_club_id uuid, p_agent_id uuid, p_start timestamp with time zone); Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: postgres
--

COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.sum_agent_volume(p_club_id uuid, p_agent_id uuid, p_start timestamp with time zone) IS 'One member''s audit-log volume. SERVICE ROLE ONLY - it takes another person''s user id and has no guard of its own. Its only caller is pages/api/club-arena/agent-analytics.js, which runs as the service role. Do not grant this to authenticated without writing a guard first.';


