COMMENT ON TABLE public.ca_daily_bonus_calendar IS 'The Daily Club Arena Bonus ladder. cycle_day rows repeat weekly; a streak_day row set replaces the whole day when a streak lands on it. diamonds are cents (1 diamond = 1 cent). Unreadable by players: fn_ca_daily_bonus_status projects it, fn_ca_daily_bonus_claim pays it. Amounts are Dan''s to set; edit the rows, never the functions.';


