COMMENT ON COLUMN public.diamond_platform_budget.budget_diamonds IS 'A FORECAST, NOT A GATE (ruling 21, 2026-09-08). Nothing refuses or shrinks an award because of it. Until then it both refused with budget_exhausted and silently truncated an award to whatever was left in the shared pot.';


