COMMENT ON COLUMN public.video_transcode_jobs.attempts IS 'Recovery requeue count. Incremented by /api/cron/yt-pipeline-recovery on each requeue; jobs stop being requeued at 5. Added 2026-08-14 after cron telemetry caught the recovery job failing 42703 on every tick since it shipped.';


