--

COMMENT ON CONSTRAINT chk_rake_amount_is_two_decimal_places ON public.union_rake_paid_daily_user IS 'NOT VALID deliberately. 6,881 of 8,244 rows written 2026-08-10..2026-09-01 carry sub-cent values (drift +0.2799 chips on 1,855,063.77). Historic attribution rows; the writer above them was rebuilt and has produced none since 09-01. The constraint still refuses every NEW sub-cent value.';


